          "width": "400.0px",
          "height": "200.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div style='font-family:\"Open Sans\", sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#444; line-height:1.8;'><h3 style='font-family:\"Oswald\", sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#111; letter-spacing:2px; margin-bottom:15px;'>PROFILE</h3><p>Award-winning architect with a decade of experience designing sustainable commercial and residential spaces. Adept at managing projects from conceptual design through construction administration, ensuring seamless integration of structural aesthetics and environmental efficiency.</p></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 2,
