          "innerHTML": "<div style='font-family:\"Open Sans\", sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#444; line-height:1.6;'><h3 style='font-family:\"Oswald\", sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#111; letter-spacing:2px; margin-bottom:20px;'>EXPERIENCE</h3><h4 style='font-size:14px; color:#111; margin:0 0 5px 0;'>Senior Architect | Foster & Partners</h4><p style='font-size:10px; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px 0;'>2018 - PRESENT</p><ul style='padding-left:15px; margin-bottom:25px;'><li>Lead designer for a 40-story mixed-use tower in Canary Wharf.</li><li>Spearheaded LEED Platinum certification efforts.</li></ul><h4 style='font-size:14px; color:#111; margin:0 0 5px 0;'>Architectural Designer | Zaha Hadid Architects</h4><p style='font-size:10px; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px 0;'>2013 - 2018</p><ul style='padding-left:15px;'><li>Assisted in parametric modeling for international cultural centers.</li><li>Prepared comprehensive construction documents.</li></ul></div>",
